      "writtenOn": "2025-11-21T14:58:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Luca and Edwin: I believe we all agree that the query expressions shouldn\u0027t contains terms without operator. I am adding you here because this change may affect existing submit requirements that suffer the issue described in the commit message. I would prefer to not make this behaviour configurable but instead write a warning in the release notes. WDYT?",
      "revId": "1273865c25caaf644298daf2bf3068e779e0f448",
